# Site-local additions to abstractions/libvirt-qemu, placed by the Nivuus
# console package (console/hooks/install.py).
#
# Every per-domain profile libvirt generates includes abstractions/libvirt-qemu,
# which grants exec of /usr/bin/qemu-system-* only. The console's domain runs
# the anti-detection QEMU built by host/qemu-anti-detection/build-qemu.sh
# under its own prefix, so without these two lines `virsh start` dies with
# "Permission denied" on the emulator, and the firmware blobs QEMU loads from
# its own datadir (kvmvapic.bin, vgabios-stdvga.bin, efi-virtio.rom...) are
# unreadable. The prefix is qemu_build.QEMU_PREFIX; keep the two in sync.
  /opt/qemu-anti-detection/bin/qemu-system-x86_64 rmix,
  /opt/qemu-anti-detection/share/qemu/** r,
